      "native": {
        "event": {
          "timestamp": "2026-03-23T00:05:32.321Z",
          "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse",
          "session_id": "0d0647a2-5918-4288-ab03-e1916a307a75",
          "tool_name": "memory",
          "tool_input": {
            "command": "create",
            "path": "/memories/session/uri-exploration-notes.md",
            "file_text": "# URI Mechanism Exploration Notes\n\n## Entity Kinds (Complete List)\n**Count: 24 kinds**\n1. root - repository root\n2. year - time document: year\n3. month - time document: month  \n4. day - time document: day (used for tickets)\n5. hour - time document: hour\n6. minute - time document: minute\n7. second - time document: second\n8. project - technology project\n9. bundle - code bundle within a project\n10. folder - filesystem folder\n11. file - filesystem file\n12. line - single line in a file\n13. range - line range in a file\n14. section - named code section (via regions/comments)\n15. definition - named function/class/entity within a section\n16. goal - milestone or objective\n17. ticket - work item (tracked by date under goals)\n18. draft - proposal/work draft\n19. todo - task/todo item\n20. policy - code policy/rule\n21. statute - specific rule within a policy\n22. breach - policy violation\n23. contributor - person who made contributions\n24. commit - git commit\n25. interaction - event (create, edit, start, finish, restart, delete)\n\n## Current URI Format Pattern\n**Scheme**: `repo://`\n**General Structure**: `repo://{{entity-kind}}/{{path-or-id}}`\n\n### Temporal URIs (Time-based)\n- `repo://` - root\n- `repo://years` - all years\n- `repo://year/26` - specific year\n- `repo://months/26` - all months in year\n- `repo://month/26/02` - specific month\n- `repo://days/26/02` - all days in month\n- `repo://day/26/02/15` - specific day\n- `repo://hours/26/02/15` - hours in day\n- `repo://hour/26/02/15/14` - specific hour\n- `repo://minutes/26/02/15/14` - minutes in hour\n- `repo://minute/26/02/15/14/33` - specific minute\n- `repo://seconds/26/02/15/14/33` - seconds in minute\n- `repo://second/26/02/15/14/33/38` - specific second\n\n### Project/Bundle URIs\n- `repo://projects` - all projects\n- `repo://project/compose` - specific project by id\n- `repo://bundles/compose` - all bundles in project\n- `repo://bundle/compose/js` - specific bundle\n\n### File System URIs\n- `repo://folders/compose/js` - folders in path\n- `repo://folder/compose/js/sketchpad` - specific folder\n- `repo://files/compose/js` - files in path\n- `repo://file/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx` - specific file\n- `repo://lines/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx` - lines in file\n- `repo://line/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx/3872` - specific line\n- `repo://ranges/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx` - ranges in file\n- `repo://range/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx/3872/3875` - range\n\n### Code Structure URIs\n- `repo://sections/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx` - sections in file\n- `repo://section/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx/State%20Management/Design%20Store` - section\n- `repo://definitions/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx/State%20Management/Design%20Store` - defs\n- `repo://definition/compose/js/sketchpad/design.tsx/State%20Management/Design%20Store/createSketchpadStore` - def\n\n### Issue Tracking URIs\n- `repo://goals/r26.02-1` - goals (optional parent)\n- `repo://goal/r26.02-1/Running%20Sketchpad` - specific goal\n- `repo://tickets/r26.02-1/Running%20Sketchpad` - tickets under scope\n- `repo://ticket/r26.02-1/Running%20Sketchpad/Introduce%20Key%20Guid%20Uri%20Mechanism` - specific ticket\n\n### Proposal/Task URIs\n- `repo://drafts` - all drafts\n- `repo://draft/repo%3A%2F%2Fbundle%2Frepo%2Fcli/New%20Architecture` - draft with uri-encoded parent\n- `repo://todos` - all todos\n- `repo://todo/repo%3A%2F%2Fdefinition%2F.../Introduce%20Proper%20Sync` - todo\n\n### Policy/Validation URIs\n- `repo://policies/code` - policies (optional parent/kind)\n- `repo://policy/code/Godfiles` - specific policy\n- `repo://statutes/code/Godfiles` - statutes in policy\n- `repo://statute/code/Godfiles/Max%20Lines%20Per%20File` - statute\n- `repo://breaches/code/Godfiles` - breaches\n- `repo://breach/code/Godfiles/affects/repo%3A%2F%2Ffile%2F.../at/repo%3A%2F%2Frange%2F.../when/repo%3A%2F%2Fsecond%2F...` - breach\n\n### Contributor/History URIs  \n- `repo://contributors` - all contributors\n- `repo://contributor/usalu` - specific contributor\n- `repo://commits` - all commits\n- `repo://commit/cfb3b6084ff3fe883d5f39b08810a0b90997907a` - specific commit\n- `repo://interactions` - all interactions\n- `repo://interaction/when/repo%3A%2F%2Fsecond%2F.../on/repo%3A%2F%2Fticket%2F.../started/by/usalu` - interaction\n\n## Files Containing URI Specs\n1. [/workspaces/semio/.repo/💬/ueli.md](/.repo/💬/ueli.md) - **MAIN SPEC FILE** (lines 1725-1788): Complete URI format reference with all kinds\n2. [/workspaces/semio/repo/AGENTS.md](repo/AGENTS.md) - Agent instructions with URI specs\n3. [/workspaces/semio/repo/SPECS.md](repo/SPECS.md) - Repository-level requirements and specs\n\n## URI Logic Implementation\n\n### TypeScript/JavaScript (repo/vscode/)\n- **File**: [extension.ts](repo/vscode/extension.ts) (line 1087)\n- **Function**: `parseUri(uri: string): { type: string; path: string } | null`\n- **Pattern**: Regex: `/^repo:\\/\\/([a-zA-Z]+)(?:\\/(.*)?)?$/`\n- **Used by**: VSCode extension for navigation and tree view\n\n### Go (repo/cli/)\n- **File**: [main.go](repo/cli/main.go)\n- **Key Functions**:\n  - `PathToUriPath(path: string): string` (line 16823) - converts path to URI-safe format (spaces to %20)\n  - `PathFromUriPath(uriPath: string): string` - reverses PathToUriPath\n  - Multiple `GetURI()` methods on types (Project, Bundle, Ticket, Goal, Policy, etc.)\n- **URI Construction Examples**:\n  - Ticket (line 10149): `repo://y/{{YY}}/m/{{MM}}/d/{{DD}}/tk/{{slug}}`\n  - Ticket with goal: `repo://g/{{goal}}/g/...../tk/{{slug}}`\n  - Project: `repo://p/{{code}}/{{name}}`\n  - Bundle: `repo://p/{{code}}/b/{{code}}/{{name}}`\n\n### Python (compose/engine/)\n- Uses `fromUri()` class method pattern for parsing store URIs\n- Example: `SqliteStore.fromUri(uri)` (line 604)\n\n## Query Parameters\n- `{?client}` - tickets/goals with interactions from specific client\n- `{?llm}` - tickets/goals with interactions using specific LLM  \